 * but `ReducedOriginSchema` exists precisely for views that must expose
 * "only the fields those views actually render" (its own doc comment,
 * `src/types/conversation.ts`) — a remote claude.ai caller has no business
 * learning a local session's filesystem path or git branch. Origin is
